ed by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  21 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 15 35     HER 2 Addendum     RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Right  block A   HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Not Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 to chromosome 17 signals in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  23 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 16 18 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  core biopsy right breast   is a nonoriented fragment of predominantly adipose tissue with a scant amount of fibrous tissue admixed within measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  The specimen is sectioned to reveal a homogeneously yellow cut surface with no gross abnormalities  The specimen is submitted entirely in cassette A  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right breast skin stitch lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm skin ellipse excised to a depth of 2 1cm  The skin ellipse is tan with purple markings  No grossly identifiable mass is noted on the skin  The underlying adipose tissue is grossly unremarkable and consists of yellow lobulated fatty tissue  The superior resection margin is inked black and the inferior resection margin is inked blue  and the specimen is sectioned from lateral to medial to reveal no gross abnormalities  The specimen is entirely submitted from medial to lateral in cassettes B E  Resident  JOSHUA B  KISH  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST RIGHT  EXCISION PART B  BREAST RIGHT  CORE BIO