ned  fibrous areas  some of which are focally gritty  SECTION CODE A B  Biopsy cavity with closest  mid anterior  margin C D  Representative sections of fibrous tissue surrounding biopsy cavity and closest approach to mid posterior margin E  Further representative section of fibrous tissue surrounding biopsy cavity F  Representative sections of fibrous areas at the medial extent of the specimen G  Representative sections of fibrous area along the lateral posterior of specimen Resident  AARON CAPLAN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin Hughes MD PART   BREAST  RIGHT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
