sue and a small amount of breast parenchyma  Section code  A  cavity in relation to the superior green margin B  cavity in relation to the inferior yellow margin C  cavity in relation to the deep margin D  skin in relation to the cavity E  lateral margin  en face F  medial margin  en face G J  most of the cavity Also present in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm piece of breast tissue representing inferior tissue  a stitch is on the surface farthest from the biopsy cavity  The stitched margin is inked yellow and the rest inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal no areas suspicious for infiltrative carcinoma  represntative sections are submitted in K and L  Labeled Right axillary lymph nodes is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm piece of adipose tissue in which multiple lymph nodes ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 2 5cm are found entirely submitted in M through R  Resident  Essam Ahmed  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART A  RIGHT AXILLARY NODE PART B  RIGHT BREAST   report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
