this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  09 REMOVED_MONTH 99 at 16 29 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast biopsy   are two fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  Both specimens are inked and sectioned to reveal a stellate grey nodule in biopsy  2 which extends to the margin  Representative section of fragment  2 is frozen as fx  1 and resubmitted in cassette A  The remainder of fragment  2 is submitted in cassette B  Nodule  1 is entirely submitted in C D  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast biopsy   are multiple fragment of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm in aggregate  The largest fragment is inked in black  the entire specimen is sectioned to reveal grossly unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  The specimen is entirely submitted in E F  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast and axilla  is a 21 x 23 x 3cm modified radical mastectomy specimen with a 16 x 7cm skin ellipse containing a 2 7cm nipple areolar complex and a 12 x REMOVED_DATE x 2cm axillary tail  A 3 5cm curvilinear  recent surgical incision with focal erythema at its wound edges lies 0 7cm infero lateral of the nipple and 1 7cm from the inferolateral skin resection margin  The deep resection margin consists of a smooth fascial plane  The specimen is inked  the axillary tail is amputated  and the main specimen is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 2cm hemorrhagic biopsy cavity that comes to within 0 4cm of the deep resection margin and 2 0cm of the inferior portion of the anterior resection margin  all other margins are greater than 6cm away  Hemorrhagic adipose tissue surrounds the entire biopsy cavity  and gritty  tiny nodules  less than 0 1cm  over a 1 0cm area   Lie adjacent to the superior edge of the biopsy cavity  The remainder of the breast shows unremarkable white  fibrous breast parenchyma amidst adipose tissue  G H  Deep resection margin  I  Infero anterior resection margin  J K  Biopsy cavity  superior edge  L  Representative breast  M T  Axillary lymph nodes  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional left axilla contents  are two fragments of adipose tissue aggregating 1 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  submitted entirely in U  Gross Description by  GUILLERMO J TEARNEY  MD Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   NO LESIONS SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  GUILLERMO J TEARNEY  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  John Andrew Billings  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   INCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  ADDITIONAL LEFT AXILLARY CONTENTS  EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART D  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , not_surgery.
