n and greater than 2 0cm from the inferior margin  The cavity surrounds firm  mottled tan yellow to tan white tissue  No other masses or nodules are grossly identified  The remainder of the tissue consists mainly of adipose tissue  Representative sections are submitted as   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Sections including the biopsy cavity  submitted from inferior to superior Gross Dictation by Tim Robinson  on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Paula Arnell M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
