easuring in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm  Both fragments are dissected with no grossly apparent lesion observed  Representative sections are submitted in K N  Resident  IVANA DELALLE  MD  PHD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  RIGHT UPPER  ADDITIONAL    EXCISION , Mastectomy.
