me container is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of unremarkable fatty tissue  Section code  A B  biopsy cavity with anterior superior margin C  biopsy cavity with deep margin D  biopsy cavity with inferior margin E  biopsy cavity  midportion F  biopsy cavity  lateral portion G H  biopsy cavity  medial portion I  representative section  lateral to the cavity J  representative section  medial cavity Designated  left axillary node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm fibrofatty tissue from which multiple lymph nodes are extracted and submitted in K P  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA   EXCISION , Mastectomy.
